          1 |       PROGRAM ADDPRECIP12
          2 |C                .      .    .                                       .
          3 |C SUBPROGRAM:    ADDPRECIP12
          4 |C   PRGMMR: MANIKIN        ORG: W/NP22     DATE:  07-03-07
          5 |C
          6 |C ABSTRACT: PRODUCES 12-HOUR TOTAL AND CONVECTIVE PRECIPITATION BUCKETS
          7 |C              AS WELL AS SNOWFALL ON THE ETA NATIVE GRID FOR SMARTINIT
          8 |C
          9 |C PROGRAM HISTORY LOG:
